### 1. Register an HR
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "HR Manager",
  "email": "hr@testcompany.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "HR",
  "company": "Tech Corp"
}

### 2. Login as HR (Copy the token from response)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "hr@testcompany.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Create a Job (Paste HR token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/jobs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer paste_access_token_here

{
  "title": "Senior Frontend Developer",
  "description": "Looking for an experienced React developer to build an awesome user interface.",
  "company": "Tech Corp",
  "location": "Remote, India",
  "requiredSkills": ["React", "TypeScript", "Tailwind CSS"],
  "domain": "Frontend",
  "salaryMin": 1500000,
  "salaryMax": 3000000,
  "experienceLevel": "SENIOR",
  "jobType": "REMOTE"
}

### 4. Fetch All Jobs (Public route)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/jobs

### 5. Search & Filter Jobs (Public route)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/jobs?search=Frontend&location=Remote

### 6. Get Job Details by ID
# Replace ID below with the actual job ID returned from creation
GET http://localhost:5000/api/jobs/replace-with-job-id

### 7. Delete Job (Requires HR Token)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/jobs/replace-with-job-id
Authorization: Bearer paste_access_token_here
